   <state>stable</state>
   <logo>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roythethird98/quickassign/main/misc/logo.png</logo>
   <description>
      <short>
         <en>Floating toolbar on the Tickets list with configurable quick-edit dropdowns.</en>
      </short>
      <long>
         <en>Adds a floating toolbar to the GLPI Tickets list page providing quick-edit dropdowns (technician, group, category, status, pending reason, etc.). The set of dropdowns is configurable from Setup &gt; Quick Ticket Assignment, or via the wrench icon next to the plugin in Setup &gt; Plugins. Designed to speed up bulk triage workflows without leaving the ticket list.</en>
      </long>
   </description>
